~ start
if Global.offered_dumplings == true
	if Global.minigame_success == true
		Rooster: Thanks!
	else:
		Rooster: Seems like this isn't write...
	set Global.offered_dumplings = false
	=> END

Rooster: Are you the new merchant?
Rooster: I heard that you sell dumplings to the Jade Emperor.
Rooster: A tradition over 500 years old! How persistent, you must be really dedicated to your family heritage. Is there anything you'd like to ask me?

~ main_menu
- Is the Jade Emperor a fan of my family's dumplings?
	Rooster: Why yes. Why else would he continually purchase from your family all these years?
	=> main_menu
- Well actually…I was wondering if you can offer some advice.
	Rooster: Oh? Of course! I’m the Rooster that strategically built the raft and finished 10th in the Great Zodiac Race after all. I offer great advice. What would you need help with?
	=> sub_menu
- Offer dumplings
	Rooster: Thank you! I will have {{GameManager.get_ingredients()}} dumplings please.
	set Global.offered_dumplings = true
	do Global.start_dumplings_minigame()
	=> END
- Walk away
	=> END
	if [Global.offered_dumplings == false]
		Rooster: I thought you had something more to say?
	=> END
	
~ sub_menu
- I’m wondering if this is truly my destined path in life. I have never thought of leaving my family business...
	=> RoosterAdvice
- ...But now I can't help but become...lifeless. Does my life have any meaning beyond dumplings?
	=> RoosterAdvice
- Back
	=> main_menu
	
~ RoosterAdvice
Rooster: Rooster: I see. Destiny is truly a mysterious thing. I have always followed destiny and only deviated by strategizing the best path to my destiny. 
Rooster: Unfortunately, I am unable to tell you what your destiny should be. However, my wisdom has always come from working with others. 
Rooster: I'd recommend that you talk to some of the other animals to gain some insight. Perhaps one will give you the answer you seek. 
Rooster: Have you talked to Sheep yet?
=> main_menu

=> END